      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PORTIA.\nMy people do already know my mind,\nAnd will acknowledge you and Jessica\nIn place of Lord Bassanio and myself.\nSo fare you well till we shall meet again.",
